r-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 flex items-center justify-center h-[90px] text-gray-400 text-sm select-none\">Ad - After Name Lists (300×250)</div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">❓ Frequently Asked Questions About <!-- -->Alpaca<!-- --> Names</h2><div class=\"space-y-3\"><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">What are the most popular Alpaca names?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Popular Alpaca names include classic choices widely loved by pet owners and enthusiasts. For male Alpacas 🦙, names like Max, Charlie, and Buddy are timeless favorites. For female Alpacas 🦙, Bella, Luna, and Daisy tend to top the charts. Browse our full collection above to find even more options tailored to your preferences.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">How do I choose the best name for my Alpaca?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Choosing the perfect name for your Alpaca 🦙 depends on their personality, appearance, and your personal taste! Observe your Alpaca&#x27;s unique behaviors — are they playful or calm? Bold or shy? Pick a name that feels right when you say it aloud. Short, 1-2 syllable names often work best as they are easier for animals to recognize and respond to.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Can I use human names for my Alpaca?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Absolutely! Human names are very popular for Alpacas 🦙. Names like Oliver, Sophie, Jack, or Emma work wonderfully and add a personal, meaningful touch. Many pet owners prefer human names because they create a stronger emotional connection and feel more like a family member than just a pet.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">What are some unique Alpaca names?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">For unique Alpaca names 🦙, consider fantasy-inspired options, names from foreign languages, or creative invented combinations. Our Fantasy Names and Unique Names categories feature one-of-a-kind options drawn from mythology, literature, and pure imagination. You can also draw inspiration from your favorite books, movies, or video games!</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Should my Alpaca&#x27;s name be easy to pronounce?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes! Choose a name that is easy for you and your family to say consistently 🦙. Avoid names that sound too similar to common commands (like &quot;Kit&quot; for &quot;Sit&quot;). A clear, distinct name helps your Alpaca recognize when you are calling them and strengthens training effectiveness.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">📖 <!-- -->Alpaca<!-- --> Naming Guide</h2><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->1</span><span>Consider your alpaca&#x27;s personality — is it bold, shy, playful, or calm?</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->2</span><span>Look at physical traits like color, size, or unique markings.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->3</span><span>Say the name out loud — does it sound natural and easy to call?</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->4</span><span>Avoid names that sound like common commands or other pets&#x27; names.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->5</span><span>Try out a few names and see which one your alpaca responds to best.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->6</span><span>Short names (1-2 syllables) tend to be easiest for animals to learn and recognize.</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 space-y-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-6\">🔗 <!-- -->Alpaca<!-- --> Name Categories</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"/alpaca-names/\">📛<!-- --> <!-- -->Alpaca<!-- --> <!-- -->Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"/male-alpaca-names/\">♂️<!-- --> <!-- -->Alpaca<!-- --> <!-- -->Male Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"/female-alpaca-names/\">♀️<!-- --> <!-- -->Alpaca<!-- --> <!-- -->Female Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"/cute-alpaca-names/\">💕<!-- --> <!-- -->Alpaca<!-- --> <!-- -->Cute Names</a><a class=\"bg-whi